        "original_id": "09bd7c7d-7694-5451-8153-a30697e6f856",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Works: A Scholar Under Siege\n- People: Michael Braz\n- Organizations: Georgia Southern University, University System of Georgia\n- Events: Cocking affair\n\nFacts:\n- Georgia Southern University was founded in 1906 as a land-grant college.\n- Georgia Southern University is part of the University System of Georgia.\n- Georgia Southern University is the largest center of higher education in the southern half of Georgia.\n- A Scholar Under Siege is an opera in two acts.\n- Michael Braz is a contemporary American composer.\n- Michael Braz composed A Scholar Under Siege and also wrote its English-language libretto.\n- A Scholar Under Siege was composed for the centenary of Georgia Southern University.\n- The Cocking affair was adapted into the opera A Scholar Under Siege.",
